1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,791
Euronews reports that six EU countries want finance ministers to discuss a bloc-wide windfall tax on oil companies.

2
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:22,961
Germany, Italy, Austria, Poland, Portugal and Spain say energy firms are earning unusually high profits during the Middle East war and shipping disruption around Hormuz.

3
00:00:22,961 --> 00:00:30,799
Supporters argue that crisis profits should help consumers, but the EU has not yet proposed a new levy.

